Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:00:33 +1300
Subject: [PATCH] fleet: budget every merge gate and record gate evidence

The 900 s gate timeout was a single constant although every merge gate runs
through it; T-0150's passing gate exceeded that span when queue, bundle and
verification work are included. Rename the fleet setting to gate_timeout_s,
record base/merged heads and measured gate duration on every ORACLE_RESULT, and
refuse a gate or precheck whose imports resolve outside its worktree.
